<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Borders on list, Gap off.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Borders on list, Gap off.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex Brown said it added Borders Group Inc to the firm's focus list, and removed Gap Inc and QuickResponse Services Inc.</p>
<p>-- Borders rose 1-3/4 to 35-1/2, Gap was unchanged at 28-7/8 and QuickResponse lost 3-1/4 to 33.</p>
</text>
